
# ── Frontend build-time config (VITE_*) ──────────────────────────────
# Inlined into the public JS bundle. Never a secret.

# Formspree endpoint for the demo-request form. Empty = the form falls
# back to a prefilled mailto to demo@accorddental.io and says delivery
# is not configured. See .env.production for the setup steps.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
